# Cost discipline (all projects)

- Single-thread by default: work in the main thread, no parallel/background subagents unless the user explicitly asks.
- One task per message: implement only what was asked, then stop and report. Never chain test+review+next-task unprompted.
- Reviewers (@review-*, judgment-day, SDD phases) run only at work-unit close when the user asks, never after every task.
- Prefer directed searches over broad exploration; do not re-read files already read in this chat.
